          "panel_text": "VALIDATION SPEAKER EXPOSURE AND CHECKPOINT SELECTION\nIN SPEECH EMOTION RECOGNITION\nTian Xie\nUniversity of Toronto\ntianjack.xie@mail.utoronto.ca\nABSTRACT"
